;; Datahike's own read-evidence vocabulary, declared once so entries naming
;; these keys (receipt read-evidence components, retained render calls) admit
;; against the shapes seon.db.edn already defines. The keys are the
;; dependency's names (datahike.query dependency plans and cache revisions);
;; this file only organizes the registry and never scopes or renames them.
#:datahike.read{:dependency-plan :seon.db/read-dependency-plan,
                :revision :seon.db/dependency-revision}
